ac.ritual.epOWupgrade=Overworld Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Energy Pedestal with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
