ac.ritual.epAWupgrade.desc=An Abyssal Wasteland Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Overworld Energy Pedestal with Abyssal Stone Bricks, Coralium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.epDLupgrade=Dreadlands Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epDLupgrade.desc=A Dreadlands Energy Pedestal is created by infusing an Abyssal Wasteland Energy Pedestal with Dreadstone Bricks, Elysian Stone Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.epOMTupgrade=Omothol Energy Pedestal
ac.ritual.epOMTupgrade.desc=An Omothol Energy Pedestal is created by infusing a Dreadlands Energy Pedestal with Ethaxium Bricks, Dark Ethaxium Bricks, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.saOWupgrade=Overworld Sacrificial Altar
ac.ritual.saOWupgrade.desc=An Overworld Sacrificial Altar is created by infusing a Sacrificial Altar with Cobblestone, Darkstone Cobblestone, Shadow Gem Shards and Coralium Gems.
ac.ritual.saAWupgrade=Abyssal Wasteland Sacrificial Altar
